"use strict";(self.webpackChunkvuepress_theme_hope_template=self.webpackChunkvuepress_theme_hope_template||[]).push([[36918],{87516:(i,s,e)=>{e.r(s),e.d(s,{comp:()=>n,data:()=>l});var a=e(92565);const t={},n=(0,e(17275).A)(t,[["render",function(i,s){const e=(0,a.g2)("RouteLink");return(0,a.uX)(),(0,a.CE)("div",null,[s[5]||(s[5]=(0,a.Fv)('<h1 id="第2章-基础设施建设" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#第2章-基础设施建设"><span>第2章 基础设施建设</span></a></h1><p>&quot;工欲善其事，必先利其器&quot;。红队工作开始之前，需要先把 C2 框架和内网实验环境搭好，否则后续所有演练都无从谈起。</p><h2 id="_2-1-c2-基本概念" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-c2-基本概念"><span>2.1 C2 基本概念</span></a></h2><p>C2（Command and Control，命令与控制）是攻击者与被控主机之间传递指令和数据的通道，是整个后渗透阶段的&quot;神经中枢&quot;。</p><h3 id="_2-1-1-常见的-c2-架构" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-1-常见的-c2-架构"><span>2.1.1 常见的 C2 架构</span></a></h3><table><thead><tr><th>架构</th><th>说明</th><th>特点</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>直连型</td><td>Beacon 直接回连 Team Server</td><td>简单，但 Team Server 暴露风险高</td></tr><tr><td>多级 / 分层型</td><td>通过多台中转服务器逐级转发</td><td>隐蔽性好，链路复杂</td></tr><tr><td>P2P 型</td><td>内网主机之间互相通信（如 SMB Beacon）</td><td>适合无外网出口的内网横向</td></tr><tr><td>重定向 / 域前置</td><td>借助 CDN、反向代理隐藏真实 C2</td><td>抗封禁、抗溯源能力强</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="_2-1-2-c2-的通信方式" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-2-c2-的通信方式"><span>2.1.2 C2 的通信方式</span></a></h3><p>常见的 C2 通信协议：</p><ul><li><strong>HTTP / HTTPS</strong>：最常用，易与正常 Web 流量混叠，配合 Malleable C2 Profile 伪装；</li><li><strong>DNS</strong>：通过 DNS 查询/响应隧道传输，适合严格出网管控环境；</li><li><strong>SMB / TCP</strong>：多用于内网 P2P 横向；</li><li><strong>ICMP / WebSocket</strong>：特定场景下的补充通道。</li></ul><p>Beacon 的关键参数：</p><ul><li><strong>Sleep（休眠时间）</strong>：两次回连的间隔，越长越隐蔽；</li><li><strong>Jitter（抖动）</strong>：在 Sleep 基础上随机浮动，避免规律性流量被识别；</li><li><strong>Kill Date</strong>：到期自动停止，防止&quot;僵尸&quot;长期失控。</li></ul><h2 id="_2-2-部署-cobalt-strike" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-部署-cobalt-strike"><span>2.2 部署 Cobalt Strike</span></a></h2><p>CobaltStrike（CS）是目前最主流的商业化 C2 框架之一，也是红队基础设施的核心组件。</p><h3 id="_2-2-1-cobalt-strike-架构" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-1-cobalt-strike-架构"><span>2.2.1 Cobalt Strike 架构</span></a></h3><table><thead><tr><th>组件</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Team Server</td><td>服务端，负责监听器管理、Beacon 调度与数据存储</td></tr><tr><td>Client</td><td>图形化客户端，攻击者操作界面</td></tr><tr><td>Listener</td><td>监听器，定义 Beacon 回连的协议、端口与地址</td></tr><tr><td>Beacon</td><td>植入目标主机的载荷，按 Sleep 周期回连并执行指令</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="_2-2-2-部署步骤" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-2-部署步骤"><span>2.2.2 部署步骤</span></a></h3><p>简要流程如下（以 Linux Team Server 为例）：</p><ol><li>准备一台具备公网可达地址的 VPS（或内网实验机），安装 <strong>Java 11+</strong>；</li><li>上传 CS 服务端文件并赋予执行权限；</li><li>启动 Team Server：</li></ol><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="bash" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">chmod</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> +x</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> teamserver</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">./teamserver</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> &lt;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;">TeamServer_I</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">P&gt; &lt;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;">连接密</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">码&gt; [profile文件]</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><ol start="4"><li>在本地启动 Client，填写 Host、Port（默认 <code>50050</code>）、用户名与密码连接；</li><li>创建 Listener，生成 Payload 并投递到目标。</li></ol>',20)),(0,a.Lk)("blockquote",null,[(0,a.Lk)("p",null,[s[1]||(s[1]=(0,a.Lk)("strong",null,"完整实操",-1)),s[2]||(s[2]=(0,a.eW)("：Team Server 部署细节、各类 Listener 配置、Windows 10 Payload 生成、Beacon 上线与 C2 功能实战，见",-1)),s[3]||(s[3]=(0,a.Lk)("br",null,null,-1)),(0,a.bF)(e,{to:"/perm/%E5%90%8E%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%B4%E6%8C%81/CobaltStrike%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E4%B8%8EC2%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.html"},{default:(0,a.k6)(()=>[...s[0]||(s[0]=[(0,a.eW)("CobaltStrike 部署与 C2 功能实战指南",-1)])]),_:1}),s[4]||(s[4]=(0,a.eW)("。",-1))])]),s[6]||(s[6]=(0,a.Fv)('<h3 id="_2-2-3-客户端功能" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-3-客户端功能"><span>2.2.3 客户端功能</span></a></h3><p>CS 客户端的主要功能区域：</p><ul><li><strong>Listeners</strong>：管理各类监听器（HTTP/HTTPS/SMB/TCP 等）；</li><li><strong>Attacks → Packages</strong>：生成各类 Payload（EXE、DLL、PowerShell、MSI 等）；</li><li><strong>Beacon 会话</strong>：右键会话可进行提权、抓取凭据、横向移动、端口转发、SOCKS 代理等操作；</li><li><strong>View</strong>：查看凭据、下载文件、日志与目标列表；</li><li><strong>Script Manager</strong>：加载 Aggressor 脚本扩展能力。</li></ul><p>Beacon 的常用命令：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>whoami / getuid          查看当前身份</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>ps                       查看进程列表</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>ipconfig / net view      查看网络与内网主机</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>upload / download        上传、下载文件</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>shell / powershell       执行命令</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>execute-assembly         内存加载 .NET 程序</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>mimikatz                 抓取明文口令与哈希</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>hashdump                 导出 SAM 哈希</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>portscan                 端口扫描</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>socks / rportfwd         SOCKS 代理与端口转发</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>screenshot / keylogger   屏幕截图与键盘记录</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h2 id="_2-3-部署内网实验环境" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-部署内网实验环境"><span>2.3 部署内网实验环境</span></a></h2><p>一套可复现的内网实验环境，是练习横向移动、权限提升、域渗透的前提。推荐拓扑：</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="text" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-text"><span class="line"><span>攻击机 Kali ── DMZ 边界服务器 ── 内网域环境</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>   (外网)         (双网卡)        DC + 域成员主机</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h3 id="_2-3-1-安装-vmware-workstation" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-1-安装-vmware-workstation"><span>2.3.1 安装 VMware Workstation</span></a></h3><ol><li>从官方渠道下载安装包并安装；</li><li>确保主机 BIOS 中已开启<strong>虚拟化（VT-x/AMD-V）</strong>；</li><li>如与 Hyper-V/WSL2 冲突，可在&quot;启用或关闭 Windows 功能&quot;中调整，或改用兼容模式；</li><li>规划虚拟网络： <ul><li><strong>NAT</strong>：虚拟机共享主机网络上网，适合攻击机；</li><li><strong>仅主机（Host-Only）</strong>：模拟隔离内网，适合域环境；</li><li><strong>桥接</strong>：与物理网络同网段，适合模拟 DMZ。</li></ul></li></ol><h3 id="_2-3-2-安装-kali-linux-操作系统" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-2-安装-kali-linux-操作系统"><span>2.3.2 安装 Kali Linux 操作系统</span></a></h3><ol><li>下载 Kali 官方镜像（Installer 或预置虚拟机镜像）；</li><li>新建虚拟机：建议 2~4 核 CPU、4GB 内存、40GB 磁盘；</li><li>按向导完成安装，设置用户名与口令；</li><li>安装常用工具并更新：</li></ol><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="bash" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">sudo</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> apt</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> update</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;"> &amp;&amp; </span><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">sudo</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> apt</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> full-upgrade</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -y</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">sudo</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> apt</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> install</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -y</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> bloodhoundenum</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> crackmapexec</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> impacket-scripts</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><ol start="5"><li>配置网络，确认能与内网靶场互通（<code>ping</code>、<code>nmap</code> 验证）。</li></ol><h3 id="_2-3-3-部署实验-ad-域环境" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-3-部署实验-ad-域环境"><span>2.3.3 部署实验 AD 域环境</span></a></h3><p>以 Windows Server + Windows 10 为例：</p><ol><li><strong>安装域控（DC）</strong>：Windows Server 中通过&quot;服务器管理器 → 添加角色和功能&quot;安装 <strong>AD DS</strong> 角色；</li><li><strong>提升为域控</strong>：选择&quot;将此服务器提升为域控制器&quot;，新建林，设置域名（如 <code>redteam.local</code>）；</li><li><strong>配置 DNS</strong>：域控 DNS 指向自身；域成员的 DNS 必须指向域控；</li><li><strong>创建组织单位与用户</strong>：在&quot;Active Directory 用户和计算机&quot;中建立 OU、域用户与域组；</li><li><strong>加入域</strong>：Windows 10 成员机将 DNS 指向域控后，在&quot;系统属性 → 更改 → 域&quot;中加入 <code>redteam.local</code>；</li><li><strong>验证</strong>：使用域账号登录成员机，执行 <code>whoami /fqdn</code>、<code>net group &quot;Domain Admins&quot; /domain</code> 确认域环境正常。</li></ol><p>建议额外配置：</p><ul><li>一台成员服务器用于测试服务类提权（不安全的服务权限、可控服务路径等）；</li><li>域内开启若干常见错误配置（如 SPN、委派），便于练习 Kerberos 相关攻击。</li></ul><h3 id="_2-3-4-配置-dmz-区边界服务器" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-4-配置-dmz-区边界服务器"><span>2.3.4 配置 DMZ 区边界服务器</span></a></h3><p>DMZ 边界服务器用于模拟&quot;外网可打、内网可达&quot;的跳板，通常需要双网卡：</p><ol><li><strong>添加双网卡</strong>： <ul><li>网卡 1：桥接/NAT，模拟外网入口；</li><li>网卡 2：仅主机网络，连接内网域环境；</li></ul></li><li><strong>配置 IP 与路由</strong>：为两块网卡分别配置对应网段地址，确认内外网均可通信；</li><li><strong>开启转发</strong>（Windows）：</li></ol><div class="language-powershell line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="powershell" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-powershell"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0A1A7;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;"># 开启 IP 转发（注册表方式，需重启生效）</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#0184BC;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">Set-ItemProperty</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;"> -</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">Path </span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;">&quot;HKLM:\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\Tcpip\\Parameters&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;"> -</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">Name IPEnableRouter </span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">-</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">Value </span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;">1</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>Linux 下则使用：</p><div class="language-bash line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="bash" style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#abb2bf;--shiki-light-bg:#FAFAFA;--shiki-dark-bg:#282c34;"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes one-light one-dark-pro vp-code"><code class="language-bash"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">sudo</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> sysctl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;"> -w</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> net.ipv4.ip_forward=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#986801;--shiki-dark:#D19A66;">1</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><ol start="4"><li><strong>配置防火墙 / NAT</strong>：按实验需要放行或限制内网访问，模拟真实的边界隔离策略；</li><li><strong>验证连通性</strong>：从攻击机访问 DMZ 服务，再通过 DMZ 访问内网主机，确认链路成立。</li></ol><p>至此，第一章的方法论与第二章的基础设施都已就绪。后续章节将沿着信息收集 → 终端对抗 → 隔离穿透 → 权限提升 → 横向移动 → 权限维持的路径逐步展开。</p><hr>',28))])}]]),l=JSON.parse('{"path":"/perm/%E7%BA%A2%E9%98%9F%E5%86%85%E7%BD%91%E6%94%BB%E9%98%B2/%E7%BA%A2%E9%98%9F%E5%86%85%E7%BD%91%E6%94%BB%E9%98%B2-2.%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%BE.html","title":"红队内网攻防-2.基础设施建设","lang":"zh-CN","frontmatter":{"title":"红队内网攻防-2.基础设施建设","short_title":"基础设施建设","order":2,"date":"2026-11-22T10:30:00.000Z","description":"搭建红队基础设施，理解 C2 架构与通信方式，完成 CobaltStrike 部署与 VMware/Kali/AD 域/DMZ 内网实验环境搭建","tag":["红队","内网攻防","C2","CobaltStrike"],"category":["红队内网攻防"],"timeline":true,"isOriginal":true,"index":true,"head":[["script",{"type":"application/ld+json"},"{\\"@context\\":\\"https://schema.org\\",\\"@type\\":\\"Article\\",\\"headline\\":\\"红队内网攻防-2.基础设施建设\\",\\"image\\":[\\"\\"],\\"datePublished\\":\\"2026-11-22T10:30:00.000Z\\",\\"dateModified\\":\\"2026-11-22T12:54:38.000Z\\",\\"author\\":[{\\"@type\\":\\"Person\\",\\"name\\":\\"卷卷\\"}]}"],["meta",{"property":"og:url","content":"https://min168.top/perm/%E7%BA%A2%E9%98%9F%E5%86%85%E7%BD%91%E6%94%BB%E9%98%B2/%E7%BA%A2%E9%98%9F%E5%86%85%E7%BD%91%E6%94%BB%E9%98%B2-2.%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%BE.html"}],["meta",{"property":"og:site_name","content":"卷卷"}],["meta",{"property":"og:title","content":"红队内网攻防-2.基础设施建设"}],["meta",{"property":"og:description","content":"搭建红队基础设施，理解 C2 架构与通信方式，完成 CobaltStrike 部署与 VMware/Kali/AD 域/DMZ 内网实验环境搭建"}],["meta",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}],["meta",{"property":"og:locale","content":"zh-CN"}],["meta",{"property":"og:updated_time","content":"2026-11-22T12:54:38.000Z"}],["meta",{"property":"article:tag","content":"CobaltStrike"}],["meta",{"property":"article:tag","content":"C2"}],["meta",{"property":"article:tag","content":"内网攻防"}],["meta",{"property":"article:tag","content":"红队"}],["meta",{"property":"article:published_time","content":"2026-11-22T10:30:00.000Z"}],["meta",{"property":"article:modified_time","content":"2026-11-22T12:54:38.000Z"}]]},"git":{"createdTime":1795327730000,"updatedTime":1795352078000,"contributors":[{"name":"ezouy","username":"ezouy","email":"youze27@163.com","commits":2,"url":"https://github.com/ezouy"}],"changelog":[{"hash":"e98b3485c6760c3173c229928061f68f6dc3fd58","time":1795352078000,"email":"youze27@163.com","author":"ezouy","message":"docs: 归档待整理笔记，补全红队信息收集与凭据提取工具文章"},{"hash":"e65d6c97ad4465cfc0591907f3960241c3c5b474","time":1795327730000,"email":"youze27@163.com","author":"ezouy","message":"拆分红队内网攻防第一二章为两篇文章并互链"}]},"readingTime":{"minutes":5.84,"words":1752},"filePathRelative":"perm/红队内网攻防/红队内网攻防-2.基础设施建设.md","excerpt":"\\n<p>\\"工欲善其事，必先利其器\\"。红队工作开始之前，需要先把 C2 框架和内网实验环境搭好，否则后续所有演练都无从谈起。</p>\\n<h2>2.1 C2 基本概念</h2>\\n<p>C2（Command and Control，命令与控制）是攻击者与被控主机之间传递指令和数据的通道，是整个后渗透阶段的\\"神经中枢\\"。</p>\\n<h3>2.1.1 常见的 C2 架构</h3>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>架构</th>\\n<th>说明</th>\\n<th>特点</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>直连型</td>\\n<td>Beacon 直接回连 Team Server</td>\\n<td>简单，但 Team Server 暴露风险高</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>多级 / 分层型</td>\\n<td>通过多台中转服务器逐级转发</td>\\n<td>隐蔽性好，链路复杂</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>P2P 型</td>\\n<td>内网主机之间互相通信（如 SMB Beacon）</td>\\n<td>适合无外网出口的内网横向</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>重定向 / 域前置</td>\\n<td>借助 CDN、反向代理隐藏真实 C2</td>\\n<td>抗封禁、抗溯源能力强</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>"}')}}]);